{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f75-1ff0-7290-8d64-5d889a9cb35b", "item_id": "item-497", "rollout_ordinal": 3100, "created_at_ms": 1788308186823, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3100, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-497", "text": "Validacion tecnica paso. Actualizo la nota del README para que quede documentado el nuevo criterio visual: bloques esperados y trazo coloreado por precision.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f75-1ff0-7290-8d64-5d889a9cb35b", "item_id": "call_zLJ1UX9ruWx5EFXVtBEOSyLL", "rollout_ordinal": 3103, "created_at_ms": 1788308188071, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3103, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_zLJ1UX9ruWx5EFXVtBEOSyLL", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\README.md", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -26,2 +26,3 @@\n - muestra la curva esperada antes de cantar\n+- muestra la referencia como bloques de nota y colorea la voz segun precision\n - inicia la instrumental y la grabacion con `sounddevice.playrec`\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f75-1ff0-7290-8d64-5d889a9cb35b", "item_id": "item-498", "rollout_ordinal": 3106, "created_at_ms": 1788308194394, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 3106, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-498", "summary": ["**Inspecting code usage and final validation**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f75-1ff0-7290-8d64-5d889a9cb35b", "item_id": "item-499", "rollout_ordinal": 3108, "created_at_ms": 1788308195213, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3108, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-499", "text": "Hay una funcion antigua que ya no participa en el grafico nuevo. La voy a retirar para que no haya dos maneras de dibujar curvas conviviendo sin razon.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f75-1ff0-7290-8d64-5d889a9cb35b", "item_id": "item-500", "rollout_ordinal": 3113, "created_at_ms": 1788308200511, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3113, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-500", "text": "Confirmado: ya no se usa. La quito y valido una ultima vez.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f75-1ff0-7290-8d64-5d889a9cb35b", "item_id": "call_1xx1Xix9d1xg4TB2u6DfGNIo", "rollout_ordinal": 3116, "created_at_ms": 1788308203935, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3116, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_1xx1Xix9d1xg4TB2u6DfGNIo", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -883,16 +883,2 @@\n \n-function buildPath(points) {\n-  const domain = visibleDomain();\n-  const visible = points.filter(([time]) => time >= domain.xMin - 0.4 && time <= domain.xMax + 0.4);\n-  if (!visible.length) return \"\";\n-\n-  return visible\n-    .map(([time, midi], index) => {\n-      const previous = visible[index - 1];\n-      const startsSegment = !previous || time - previous[0] > PATH_GAP_BREAK_SECONDS;\n-      return `${startsSegment ? \"M\" : \"L\"} ${xScale(time).toFixed(1)} ${yScale(midi).toFixed(1)}`;\n-    })\n-    .join(\" \");\n-}\n-\n function renderGrid() {\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f75-1ff0-7290-8d64-5d889a9cb35b", "item_id": "item-501", "rollout_ordinal": 3119, "created_at_ms": 1788308211498, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3119, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-501", "text": "Voy con la validacion final corta.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f75-1ff0-7290-8d64-5d889a9cb35b", "item_id": "item-502", "rollout_ordinal": 3127, "created_at_ms": 1788308222966, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3127, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-502", "text": "Listo, cambié el gráfico hacia la opción 3.\n\nAhora la visualización principal funciona así:\n\n- **Referencia**: bloques naranjos por nota esperada.\n- **Voz afinada**: trazo verde cuando está dentro de ±50 cents.\n- **Cerca**: trazo amarillo entre ±50 y ±100 cents.\n- **Fuera**: trazo rojo cuando supera ±100 cents.\n- **Sin ref.**: trazo gris cuando hay voz detectada pero no hay una nota de referencia cercana, útil para silencios o zonas dudosas.\n\nTambién dejé la capa más liviana para tiempo real: los bloques de referencia se cachean y el color del usuario se calcula en una pasada, para no volver a introducir tirones mientras cantas.\n\nArchivos modificados:\n\n- [ui_live/index.html](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/index.html>)\n- [ui_live/app.js](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/app.js>)\n- [ui_live/styles.css](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/styles.css>)\n- [ui_live/README.md](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/README.md>)\n\nValidé sintaxis JS y que todos los IDs nuevos estén conectados. Para verlo:\n\n```powershell\n.\\iniciar_live.bat\n```", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f81-4f11-7070-b6f4-2439becef7e4", "item_id": "item-503", "rollout_ordinal": 3135, "created_at_ms": 1788308705166, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3135, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-503", "clientId": "88c439af-eb51-4d6a-9e9d-219f5f614896", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "bien encaminado pero no, quiero que se ilumine el recuadro donde está la nota del usuario, el cuadro de la nota de referencia está en un color que no me convence, podría ser un blanco grisaseo, y que pinte el cuadro del usuario de los colores que hablamos, la linea intenta hacerla más delgada, así como en la imagen de referencia\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f81-4f11-7070-b6f4-2439becef7e4", "item_id": "item-504", "rollout_ordinal": 3136, "created_at_ms": 1788308718309, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 3137, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-504", "summary": ["**Planning UI chart highlight changes**", "**Designing layered SVG chart elements**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f81-4f11-7070-b6f4-2439becef7e4", "item_id": "item-505", "rollout_ordinal": 3139, "created_at_ms": 1788308719513, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3139, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-505", "text": "Sí, entiendo el ajuste: no quieres que el color viva principalmente en la línea, sino en el “casillero” de la nota cantada. Voy a dejar la referencia en blanco grisáceo, pintar bloques del usuario por precisión y adelgazar la línea para que funcione como trazo de afinación encima.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f81-4f11-7070-b6f4-2439becef7e4", "item_id": "item-506", "rollout_ordinal": 3149, "created_at_ms": 1788308740834, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 3150, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-506", "summary": ["**Planning userBlockLayer addition**", "**Designing merged user blocks and white line layers**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f81-4f11-7070-b6f4-2439becef7e4", "item_id": "item-507", "rollout_ordinal": 3152, "created_at_ms": 1788308741954, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3152, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-507", "text": "Voy a añadir una capa nueva para los bloques del usuario. La referencia quedará detrás en gris claro; encima irán los recuadros del usuario coloreados y, finalmente, una línea fina blanca para indicar el pitch exacto.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f81-4f11-7070-b6f4-2439becef7e4", "item_id": "call_Zp9bFxeRgoWPYTJ366BRmdK9", "rollout_ordinal": 3155, "created_at_ms": 1788308743673, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3155, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_Zp9bFxeRgoWPYTJ366BRmdK9", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\index.html", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -207,2 +207,3 @@\n           <path id=\"referencePath\" class=\"reference-line\"></path>\n+          <g id=\"userBlockLayer\"></g>\n           <g id=\"userSegmentLayer\"></g>\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f81-4f11-7070-b6f4-2439becef7e4", "item_id": "call_0Ssf92YAL5S6lz7aICAFbTAX", "rollout_ordinal": 3159, "created_at_ms": 1788308750977, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3159, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_0Ssf92YAL5S6lz7aICAFbTAX", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -8,2 +8,3 @@\n const REFERENCE_BLOCK_HALF_STEPS = 0.45;\n+const USER_BLOCK_HALF_STEPS = 0.46;\n const USER_GOOD_CENTS = 50;\n@@ -73,2 +74,3 @@\n   referencePath: document.getElementById(\"referencePath\"),\n+  userBlockLayer: document.getElementById(\"userBlockLayer\"),\n   userSegmentLayer: document.getElementById(\"userSegmentLayer\"),\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f81-4f11-7070-b6f4-2439becef7e4", "item_id": "item-508", "rollout_ordinal": 3162, "created_at_ms": 1788308756428, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3162, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-508", "text": "Ahora cambio la funcion que antes pintaba segmentos de línea: ahora generara bloques discretos para el usuario y una línea blanca separada.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f81-4f11-7070-b6f4-2439becef7e4", "item_id": "call_bGD66JiyzSJEkgF4zOgloIXt", "rollout_ordinal": 3165, "created_at_ms": 1788308770681, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3165, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_bGD66JiyzSJEkgF4zOgloIXt", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -823,2 +823,6 @@\n function buildReferenceBlockPath(blocks) {\n+  return buildNoteBlockPath(blocks, REFERENCE_BLOCK_HALF_STEPS);\n+}\n+\n+function buildNoteBlockPath(blocks, halfSteps) {\n   const domain = visibleDomain();\n@@ -836,4 +840,4 @@\n     const x2 = xScale(end);\n-    const y1 = yScale(block.note + REFERENCE_BLOCK_HALF_STEPS);\n-    const y2 = yScale(block.note - REFERENCE_BLOCK_HALF_STEPS);\n+    const y1 = yScale(block.note + halfSteps);\n+    const y2 = yScale(block.note - halfSteps);\n     commands.push(`M ${x1.toFixed(1)} ${y1.toFixed(1)} H ${x2.toFixed(1)} V ${y2.toFixed(1)} H ${x1.toFixed(1)} Z`);\n@@ -851,6 +855,6 @@\n \n-function renderUserAccuracySegments(referenceBlocks) {\n+function renderUserAccuracy(referenceBlocks) {\n   const points = finitePitchPoints(userPointsForChart());\n   const domain = visibleDomain();\n-  const paths = {\n+  const blocksByClass = {\n     good: [],\n@@ -860,2 +864,3 @@\n   };\n+  const lineCommands = [];\n   let blockIndex = 0;\n@@ -876,9 +881,17 @@\n     const className = accuracyClass(cents);\n-    paths[className].push(`M ${xScale(t1).toFixed(1)} ${yScale(m1).toFixed(1)} L ${xScale(t2).toFixed(1)} ${yScale(m2).toFixed(1)}`);\n+    blocksByClass[className].push({\n+      start: t1,\n+      end: t2,\n+      note: Math.round(averageMidi)\n+    });\n+    lineCommands.push(`M ${xScale(t1).toFixed(1)} ${yScale(m1).toFixed(1)} L ${xScale(t2).toFixed(1)} ${yScale(m2).toFixed(1)}`);\n   }\n \n-  els.userSegmentLayer.innerHTML = Object.entries(paths)\n-    .filter(([, commands]) => commands.length)\n-    .map(([className, commands]) => `<path class=\"user-line user-${className}\" d=\"${commands.join(\" \")}\"></path>`)\n+  els.userBlockLayer.innerHTML = Object.entries(blocksByClass)\n+    .map(([className, blocks]) => [className, mergeReferenceBlocks(blocks)])\n+    .filter(([, blocks]) => blocks.length)\n+    .map(([className, blocks]) => `<path class=\"user-note-blocks user-${className}\" d=\"${buildNoteBlockPath(blocks, USER_BLOCK_HALF_STEPS)}\"></path>`)\n     .join(\"\");\n+  els.userSegmentLayer.innerHTML = \"\";\n+  els.userPath.setAttribute(\"d\", lineCommands.join(\" \"));\n }\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f81-4f11-7070-b6f4-2439becef7e4", "item_id": "item-509", "rollout_ordinal": 3169, "created_at_ms": 1788308777488, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3169, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-509", "text": "Ya esta la logica de bloques del usuario. Ajusto ahora el render principal para que no borre la línea blanca después de calcularla.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
