{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f88-02d9-7760-b5b2-c7220c5c8a29", "item_id": "item-528", "rollout_ordinal": 3275, "created_at_ms": 1788309299250, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3275, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-528", "text": "Conecto los eventos del slider, reset y auto. También actualizaré la documentación para dejar claro que esta alineación es visual.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f88-02d9-7760-b5b2-c7220c5c8a29", "item_id": "call_1dgfvxrjeweBl1AxDQUgzMNH", "rollout_ordinal": 3278, "created_at_ms": 1788309302846, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3278, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_1dgfvxrjeweBl1AxDQUgzMNH", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -1827,2 +1827,11 @@\n els.notationSelect.addEventListener(\"change\", saveNotationPreference);\n+els.visualOffset.addEventListener(\"input\", () => {\n+  setVisualOffset(Number(els.visualOffset.value || 0));\n+  renderChart();\n+});\n+els.visualOffsetResetButton.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n+  setVisualOffset(0);\n+  renderChart();\n+});\n+els.visualAutoAlignButton.addEventListener(\"click\", autoAlignVisualOffset);\n voiceAudio.addEventListener(\"ended\", () => stopTakePlayback(true));\n@@ -1833,2 +1842,3 @@\n loadNotationPreference();\n+loadVisualOffsetPreference();\n renderSongs();\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f88-02d9-7760-b5b2-c7220c5c8a29", "item_id": "item-529", "rollout_ordinal": 3281, "created_at_ms": 1788309307642, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3281, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-529", "text": "Una cosa importante: cuando no hay puntos de usuario, el botón Auto no debe hacer nada raro. Ajusto ese borde y luego valido.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f88-02d9-7760-b5b2-c7220c5c8a29", "item_id": "call_9dVhFme7deOdKaDKTVySVkOq", "rollout_ordinal": 3284, "created_at_ms": 1788309309113, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3284, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_9dVhFme7deOdKaDKTVySVkOq", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -1013,2 +1013,4 @@\n function autoAlignVisualOffset() {\n+  if (!currentReferenceBlocks().length || !userPointsForChart().length) return;\n+\n   let bestOffset = state.visualOffsetMs;\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f88-02d9-7760-b5b2-c7220c5c8a29", "item_id": "item-530", "rollout_ordinal": 3287, "created_at_ms": 1788309314844, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3287, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-530", "text": "Actualizo README y corro validaciones.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f88-02d9-7760-b5b2-c7220c5c8a29", "item_id": "call_gip05KDWd6i2rgG0W7PQhw9p", "rollout_ordinal": 3290, "created_at_ms": 1788309316154, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3290, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_gip05KDWd6i2rgG0W7PQhw9p", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\README.md", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -27,2 +27,3 @@\n - muestra la referencia como bloques grisaceos y colorea el bloque del usuario segun precision\n+- permite ajustar la alineacion visual del usuario para diagnosticar desfases de latencia\n - inicia la instrumental y la grabacion con `sounddevice.playrec`\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f88-02d9-7760-b5b2-c7220c5c8a29", "item_id": "item-531", "rollout_ordinal": 3293, "created_at_ms": 1788309326585, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3293, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-531", "text": "Voy con las pruebas locales: sintaxis JS, IDs y Python.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f88-02d9-7760-b5b2-c7220c5c8a29", "item_id": "item-532", "rollout_ordinal": 3303, "created_at_ms": 1788309336072, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3303, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-532", "text": "Listo, ajusté esa parte.\n\nEl problema venía por dos cosas: algunos bloques del usuario eran tan cortos que el gráfico los descartaba, y además el color dependía de que la voz cayera justo dentro del tiempo exacto del bloque de referencia. Si había un pequeño desfase, quedaba como “Sin ref.” aunque la nota estuviera bien.\n\nAhora hice esto:\n\n- Los bloques cortos del usuario ya no se descartan tan agresivamente.\n- La referencia sigue como bloques gris/blanco.\n- El usuario ilumina su propio casillero con verde/amarillo/rojo.\n- La línea blanca del pitch queda más delgada.\n- Agregué **Alineación visual** bajo la barra de tiempo:\n  - puedes mover la voz visualmente entre `-700 ms` y `+700 ms`;\n  - botón **Auto** intenta encontrar un desfase razonable;\n  - botón **0** vuelve al centro.\n\nImportante: esa alineación es solo visual, para revisar si el problema es latencia/desfase. No modifica los audios ni las métricas guardadas todavía.\n\nValidé JS, IDs y Python. Pruébalo con:\n\n```powershell\n.\\iniciar_live.bat\n```", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "item-533", "rollout_ordinal": 3311, "created_at_ms": 1788309601280, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3311, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-533", "clientId": "94b9bf8d-9178-4581-800a-ab5c36e14fe6", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "creo que hay problemas serios con la impresión de los cuadros, algunos se crean en lugares que no corresponden, además llega un punto en que hay un pequeño chirrido en el audio y deja de imprimir la voz del usuario, aúnque al finalizar si se muestra\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "item-534", "rollout_ordinal": 3312, "created_at_ms": 1788309614049, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 3313, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-534", "summary": ["**Diagnosing audio issues with UI rendering**", "**Analyzing pitch rendering and block placement issues**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "item-535", "rollout_ordinal": 3315, "created_at_ms": 1788309615367, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3315, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-535", "text": "Sí, ahí ya no es solo estética: hay dos frentes mezclados. Voy a separar el problema en visual y audio/tiempo real: primero corregiré cómo se construyen los cuadros para que no inventen posiciones, y después revisaré el flujo de pitch en vivo para evitar que se congele mientras la grabación sí sigue guardándose.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "item-536", "rollout_ordinal": 3327, "created_at_ms": 1788309686544, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 3332, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-536", "summary": ["**Analyzing block placement issues**", "**Diagnosing missing user line segments**", "**Planning stable note segmentation and fixing audio glitches**", "**Adding exception handling and optimizing live processing**", "**Planning pitch point filtering and throttled rendering**", "**Designing smoothed note blocks and robust live pitch handling**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "item-537", "rollout_ordinal": 3334, "created_at_ms": 1788309687189, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3334, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-537", "text": "Voy a hacer tres correcciones concretas: estabilizar la conversión de puntos a cuadros, evitar recalcular miles de puntos por frame, y hacer que el worker de pitch en vivo no muera si una ventana de audio falla. Esto debería atacar tanto los cuadros mal puestos como el “deja de imprimir” en vivo.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "call_eRhT4gtVtsoJfdD1V9TZtfcu", "rollout_ordinal": 3337, "created_at_ms": 1788309690323, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3337, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_eRhT4gtVtsoJfdD1V9TZtfcu", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -7,2 +7,3 @@\n const NOTE_STALE_SECONDS = 0.45;\n+const LIVE_RENDER_MS = 33;\n const REFERENCE_BLOCK_HALF_STEPS = 0.45;\n@@ -12,2 +13,3 @@\n const REFERENCE_TIME_TOLERANCE_SECONDS = 0.45;\n+const USER_BLOCK_GAP_SECONDS = 0.28;\n \n@@ -35,2 +37,3 @@\n   backendPollAt: null,\n+  lastChartPaintAt: 0,\n   lastUserPitchAt: null,\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "item-538", "rollout_ordinal": 3344, "created_at_ms": 1788309718642, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 3345, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-538", "summary": ["**Planning pitch points sorting and filtering**", "**Designing note block smoothing and segmentation**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "item-539", "rollout_ordinal": 3347, "created_at_ms": 1788309719735, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3347, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-539", "text": "El ajuste de cuadros va a cambiar de “un cuadro por par de puntos” a “bloques estables por nota”. Eso evita que un salto, un vibrato o una transición cree rectángulos en filas que no corresponden.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "call_em3URrRaBZT5U36QDrTCyK20", "rollout_ordinal": 3350, "created_at_ms": 1788309721283, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3350, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_em3URrRaBZT5U36QDrTCyK20", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -779,3 +779,3 @@\n   });\n-  visualUserPointsForChart().forEach(([time, midi]) => {\n+  visibleShiftedUserPoints(domain, 0).forEach(([time, midi]) => {\n     if (time >= domain.xMin && time <= domain.xMax) values.push(midi);\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "call_0YuAIMv0RCQiAzQnHCNREUbb", "rollout_ordinal": 3354, "created_at_ms": 1788309756602, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3354, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_0YuAIMv0RCQiAzQnHCNREUbb", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -801,4 +801,65 @@\n \n+function lowerBoundPitch(points, targetTime) {\n+  let low = 0;\n+  let high = points.length;\n+  while (low < high) {\n+    const mid = Math.floor((low + high) / 2);\n+    if ((points[mid]?.[0] ?? 0) < targetTime) {\n+      low = mid + 1;\n+    } else {\n+      high = mid;\n+    }\n+  }\n+  return low;\n+}\n+\n+function visibleShiftedUserPoints(domain, padding = 0.4) {\n+  const rawPoints = userPointsForChart();\n+  const offset = state.visualOffsetMs / 1000;\n+  const rawMin = domain.xMin - padding - offset;\n+  const rawMax = domain.xMax + padding - offset;\n+  const startIndex = lowerBoundPitch(rawPoints, rawMin);\n+  const visible = [];\n+\n+  for (let i = startIndex; i < rawPoints.length; i += 1) {\n+    const [time, midi] = rawPoints[i];\n+    if (time > rawMax) break;\n+    if (!Number.isFinite(time) || !Number.isFinite(midi)) continue;\n+    visible.push([time + offset, midi]);\n+  }\n+\n+  return visible;\n+}\n+\n function referenceBlocksFromPoints(points) {\n-  const cleanPoints = finitePitchPoints(points);\n+  return noteBlocksFromPitchPoints(finitePitchPoints(points), {\n+    gapBreak: PATH_GAP_BREAK_SECONDS,\n+    maxTail: 0.18,\n+    mergeGap: 0.12,\n+    minDuration: 0.1,\n+    smoothRadius: 4\n+  });\n+}\n+\n+function userBlocksFromPoints(points) {\n+  return noteBlocksFromPitchPoints(points, {\n+    gapBreak: USER_BLOCK_GAP_SECONDS,\n+    maxTail: 0.12,\n+    mergeGap: 0.12,\n+    minDuration: 0.018,\n+    smoothRadius: 1\n+  });\n+}\n+\n+function currentReferenceBlocks() {\n+  const source = referencePoints();\n+  if (referenceBlockCache.source !== source) {\n+    referenceBlockCache.source = source;\n+    referenceBlockCache.blocks = referenceBlocksFromPoints(source);\n+  }\n+  return referenceBlockCache.blocks;\n+}\n+\n+function noteBlocksFromPitchPoints(points, options) {\n+  const cleanPoints = points.filter(([time, midi]) => Number.isFinite(time) && Number.isFinite(midi));\n   if (!cleanPoints.length) return [];\n@@ -810,3 +871,4 @@\n   }\n-  const tail = Math.min(0.18, deltas.length ? median(deltas) : 0.12);\n+\n+  const tail = Math.min(options.maxTail, deltas.length ? median(deltas) : options.maxTail);\n   const blocks = [];\n@@ -815,6 +877,6 @@\n \n-  cleanPoints.forEach(([time, midi]) => {\n-    const note = Math.round(midi);\n+  cleanPoints.forEach(([time, midi], index) => {\n+    const note = smoothedNoteAt(cleanPoints, index, options.smoothRadius);\n     if (!current) {\n-      current = { start: time, end: time + tail, note };\n+      current = createNoteBlock(time, time + tail, note, midi);\n       previous = { time, note };\n@@ -824,6 +886,6 @@\n     const gap = time - previous.time;\n-    if (gap > PATH_GAP_BREAK_SECONDS) {\n+    if (gap > options.gapBreak) {\n       current.end = previous.time + tail;\n-      blocks.push(current);\n-      current = { start: time, end: time + tail, note };\n+      blocks.push(finalizeNoteBlock(current));\n+      current = createNoteBlock(time, time + tail, note, midi);\n     } else if (note !== current.note) {\n@@ -831,6 +893,8 @@\n       current.end = boundary;\n-      blocks.push(current);\n-      current = { start: boundary, end: time + tail, note };\n+      blocks.push(finalizeNoteBlock(current));\n+      current = createNoteBlock(boundary, time + tail, note, midi);\n     } else {\n       current.end = time + tail;\n+      current.midiSum += midi;\n+      current.weight += 1;\n     }\n@@ -840,21 +904,33 @@\n \n-  if (current) blocks.push(current);\n-  return mergeReferenceBlocks(blocks);\n+  if (current) blocks.push(finalizeNoteBlock(current));\n+  return mergeNoteBlocks(blocks, options.mergeGap, options.minDuration);\n }\n \n-function currentReferenceBlocks() {\n-  const source = referencePoints();\n-  if (referenceBlockCache.source !== source) {\n-    referenceBlockCache.source = source;\n-    referenceBlockCache.blocks = referenceBlocksFromPoints(source);\n+function smoothedNoteAt(points, index, radius) {\n+  const values = [];\n+  for (let i = Math.max(0, index - radius); i <= Math.min(points.length - 1, index + radius); i += 1) {\n+    values.push(points[i][1]);\n   }\n-  return referenceBlockCache.blocks;\n+  return Math.round(median(values));\n }\n \n-function mergeReferenceBlocks(blocks) {\n-  return mergeNoteBlocks(blocks, 0.08, 0.04);\n+function createNoteBlock(start, end, note, midi) {\n+  return {\n+    start,\n+    end,\n+    note,\n+    midiSum: midi,\n+    weight: 1\n+  };\n }\n \n-function mergeUserBlocks(blocks) {\n-  return mergeNoteBlocks(blocks, 0.1, 0.006);\n+function finalizeNoteBlock(block) {\n+  const weight = Math.max(1, block.weight || 1);\n+  return {\n+    start: block.start,\n+    end: block.end,\n+    note: block.note,\n+    midi: block.midiSum / weight,\n+    weight\n+  };\n }\n@@ -868,2 +944,5 @@\n     if (previous && previous.note === block.note && block.start - previous.end <= maxGap) {\n+      const totalWeight = (previous.weight || 1) + (block.weight || 1);\n+      previous.midi = ((previous.midi || previous.note) * (previous.weight || 1) + (block.midi || block.note) * (block.weight || 1)) / totalWeight;\n+      previous.weight = totalWeight;\n       previous.end = Math.max(previous.end, block.end);\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "item-540", "rollout_ordinal": 3358, "created_at_ms": 1788309762814, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3358, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-540", "text": "Ahora el usuario se convierte a bloques por nota estable, no por cada microsegmento. También limité el render a puntos visibles, para que una toma larga no obligue a reconstruir miles de elementos todo el tiempo.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "call_WjOqQvtLcIDT1wk8mzTuoapv", "rollout_ordinal": 3361, "created_at_ms": 1788309773400, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3361, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_WjOqQvtLcIDT1wk8mzTuoapv", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -1011,4 +1011,5 @@\n function renderUserAccuracy(referenceBlocks) {\n-  const points = finitePitchPoints(visualUserPointsForChart());\n   const domain = visibleDomain();\n+  const points = visibleShiftedUserPoints(domain, 0.45);\n+  const userBlocks = userBlocksFromPoints(points);\n   const blocksByClass = {\n@@ -1028,3 +1029,7 @@\n \n-    const midpoint = (t1 + t2) / 2;\n+    lineCommands.push(`M ${xScale(t1).toFixed(1)} ${yScale(m1).toFixed(1)} L ${xScale(t2).toFixed(1)} ${yScale(m2).toFixed(1)}`);\n+  }\n+\n+  userBlocks.forEach((block) => {\n+    const midpoint = (block.start + block.end) / 2;\n     while (\n@@ -1036,15 +1041,8 @@\n     const expected = nearestReferenceBlock(referenceBlocks, midpoint, blockIndex);\n-    const averageMidi = (m1 + m2) / 2;\n-    const cents = expected ? Math.abs((averageMidi - expected.note) * 100) : null;\n+    const cents = expected ? Math.abs(((block.midi || block.note) - expected.note) * 100) : null;\n     const className = accuracyClass(cents);\n-    blocksByClass[className].push({\n-      start: t1,\n-      end: t2,\n-      note: Math.round(averageMidi)\n-    });\n-    lineCommands.push(`M ${xScale(t1).toFixed(1)} ${yScale(m1).toFixed(1)} L ${xScale(t2).toFixed(1)} ${yScale(m2).toFixed(1)}`);\n-  }\n+    blocksByClass[className].push(block);\n+  });\n \n   els.userBlockLayer.innerHTML = Object.entries(blocksByClass)\n-    .map(([className, blocks]) => [className, mergeUserBlocks(blocks)])\n     .filter(([, blocks]) => blocks.length)\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "item-541", "rollout_ordinal": 3365, "created_at_ms": 1788309778091, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3365, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-541", "text": "Voy a verificar esa zona del JS porque fue un cambio quirúrgico en una función sensible de dibujo.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "item-542", "rollout_ordinal": 3370, "created_at_ms": 1788309786078, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3370, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-542", "text": "Voy a mirar la siguiente parte para asegurar que el cierre del bucle y el coloreo quedaron bien.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "item-543", "rollout_ordinal": 3376, "created_at_ms": 1788309792774, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3376, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-543", "text": "La función crítica quedó coherente. Ahora voy a limpiar el helper viejo de desplazamiento visual si ya no se usa, y luego paso al backend de audio.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "call_l3RraoSkD1FbBN9j0JZiC2O4", "rollout_ordinal": 3382, "created_at_ms": 1788309800843, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3382, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_l3RraoSkD1FbBN9j0JZiC2O4", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -635,7 +635,2 @@\n \n-function visualUserPointsForChart() {\n-  const offset = state.visualOffsetMs / 1000;\n-  return userPointsForChart().map(([time, midi]) => [time + offset, midi]);\n-}\n-\n function selectTake(index) {\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05f8e-fb8f-7853-9ca7-fde6a7d77432", "item_id": "item-544", "rollout_ordinal": 3390, "created_at_ms": 1788309811883, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3390, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-544", "text": "Para el problema del audio y la impresión en vivo, además del backend voy a reducir la presión del frontend: seguirá animando fluido, pero no reconstruirá la gráfica 60 veces por segundo cuando hay muchos puntos.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
