{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05fd5-7126-7061-a18c-c598ad8f85e4", "item_id": "item-633", "rollout_ordinal": 3983, "created_at_ms": 1788314410972, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3983, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-633", "text": "Voy a cambiar `referencePoints()` para que entregue la versión corregida al gráfico, pero manteniendo intactos los datos originales en memoria. Así no mezclamos presentación con archivo fuente.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05fd5-7126-7061-a18c-c598ad8f85e4", "item_id": "call_GNpHlRZoirAiDJsZNvJPKIkx", "rollout_ordinal": 3986, "created_at_ms": 1788314412913, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3986, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_GNpHlRZoirAiDJsZNvJPKIkx", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -643,3 +643,8 @@\n function referencePoints() {\n-  return selectedTake()?.pointsRef || currentSong()?.points || [];\n+  const source = selectedTake()?.pointsRef || currentSong()?.points || [];\n+  if (referencePointCache.source !== source) {\n+    referencePointCache.source = source;\n+    referencePointCache.points = normalizeRegisterOctaves(source);\n+  }\n+  return referencePointCache.points;\n }\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05fd5-7126-7061-a18c-c598ad8f85e4", "item_id": "item-634", "rollout_ordinal": 3989, "created_at_ms": 1788314418171, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3989, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-634", "text": "Añado la función de corrección en JS cerca de las utilidades de pitch. La regla es conservadora: solo dobla octavas que quedan claramente fuera del registro dominante.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05fd5-7126-7061-a18c-c598ad8f85e4", "item_id": "call_GqVlM5I7lqmRoYHMpBfHoJNp", "rollout_ordinal": 3992, "created_at_ms": 1788314423202, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 3992, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_GqVlM5I7lqmRoYHMpBfHoJNp", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -823,2 +823,19 @@\n \n+function normalizeRegisterOctaves(points) {\n+  const cleanPoints = finitePitchPoints(points);\n+  if (cleanPoints.length < 30) return cleanPoints;\n+\n+  const values = cleanPoints.map(([, midi]) => midi);\n+  const center = median(values);\n+  const ceiling = Math.max(center + 14, percentile(values, 0.85) + 7);\n+  const floor = Math.min(center - 14, percentile(values, 0.15) - 7);\n+\n+  return cleanPoints.map(([time, midi]) => {\n+    let corrected = midi;\n+    while (corrected > ceiling && corrected - 12 >= floor) corrected -= 12;\n+    while (corrected < floor && corrected + 12 <= ceiling) corrected += 12;\n+    return [time, corrected];\n+  });\n+}\n+\n function lowerBoundPitch(points, targetTime) {\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05fd5-7126-7061-a18c-c598ad8f85e4", "item_id": "item-635", "rollout_ordinal": 3996, "created_at_ms": 1788314427729, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3996, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-635", "text": "Ahora haré que “Reprocesar” fuerce Demucs también. Si el problema venía del vocal stem viejo, esta es la única forma de regenerar esa base y no solo recalcular encima del mismo error.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
