{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05fea-ca90-78b2-b076-337b7d465085", "item_id": "item-687", "rollout_ordinal": 4341, "created_at_ms": 1788316085840, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 4341, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-687", "text": "Ahora añado la lógica de carga y dibujo del diagnóstico: no se calcula hasta que pulses “Analizar referencia”.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a05fea-ca90-78b2-b076-337b7d465085", "item_id": "call_yWdbpUXX4tkOQAfYDGb0kGkR", "rollout_ordinal": 4344, "created_at_ms": 1788316114122, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 4344, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_yWdbpUXX4tkOQAfYDGb0kGkR", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -578,2 +578,137 @@\n \n+async function loadReferenceDiagnostics() {\n+  const song = currentSong();\n+  if (!song || state.playing || state.catalogWorking || state.diagnosticLoading) return;\n+\n+  if (!backendReady || !window.pywebview?.api?.get_reference_diagnostics) {\n+    setStatus(\"Backend no conectado\", false);\n+    return;\n+  }\n+\n+  state.diagnosticLoading = true;\n+  renderReferenceDiagnostic();\n+  setStatus(\"Analizando referencia\", true);\n+\n+  try {\n+    const response = await window.pywebview.api.get_reference_diagnostics(song.id);\n+    if (!response.ok) {\n+      throw new Error(response.error || \"No se pudo diagnosticar la referencia.\");\n+    }\n+    state.referenceDiagnostic = response.diagnostic || null;\n+    renderReferenceDiagnostic();\n+    setStatus(\"Diagnostico listo\", false);\n+  } catch (error) {\n+    state.referenceDiagnostic = null;\n+    renderReferenceDiagnostic(String(error.message || error));\n+    setStatus(`Error: ${String(error.message || error)}`, false);\n+  } finally {\n+    state.diagnosticLoading = false;\n+    renderReferenceDiagnostic();\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function renderReferenceDiagnostic(errorMessage = \"\") {\n+  if (!els.referenceDiagnosticButton) return;\n+\n+  const song = currentSong();\n+  els.referenceDiagnosticButton.disabled = !backendReady || state.playing || state.catalogWorking || state.diagnosticLoading || !song?.prepared;\n+\n+  if (state.diagnosticLoading) {\n+    els.diagnosticStatus.textContent = \"Analizando la voz separada...\";\n+    return;\n+  }\n+\n+  const diagnostic = state.referenceDiagnostic;\n+  if (!diagnostic || errorMessage) {\n+    els.diagnosticRawCount.textContent = \"--\";\n+    els.diagnosticFilteredCount.textContent = \"--\";\n+    els.diagnosticCorrectedCount.textContent = \"--\";\n+    els.diagnosticOctaveCount.textContent = \"--\";\n+    els.diagnosticRawPath.setAttribute(\"d\", \"\");\n+    els.diagnosticFilteredPath.setAttribute(\"d\", \"\");\n+    els.diagnosticCorrectedPath.setAttribute(\"d\", \"\");\n+    els.diagnosticGridLayer.innerHTML = \"\";\n+    els.diagnosticEmpty.classList.remove(\"is-hidden\");\n+    els.diagnosticStatus.textContent = errorMessage || \"Analiza la referencia para revisar que notas se pierden o se corrigen.\";\n+    return;\n+  }\n+\n+  els.diagnosticRawCount.textContent = formatCount(diagnostic.raw_count);\n+  els.diagnosticFilteredCount.textContent = formatCount(diagnostic.filtered_count);\n+  els.diagnosticCorrectedCount.textContent = formatCount(diagnostic.corrected_count);\n+  els.diagnosticOctaveCount.textContent = formatCount(diagnostic.octave_corrections);\n+  els.diagnosticStatus.textContent = `${Number(diagnostic.retention || 0).toFixed(0)}% de puntos crudos quedaron tras el filtrado.`;\n+  els.diagnosticEmpty.classList.add(\"is-hidden\");\n+\n+  const domain = diagnosticChartDomain(diagnostic);\n+  renderDiagnosticGrid(domain);\n+  els.diagnosticRawPath.setAttribute(\"d\", diagnosticPitchPath(diagnostic.points_raw, domain, 0.24));\n+  els.diagnosticFilteredPath.setAttribute(\"d\", diagnosticPitchPath(diagnostic.points_filtered, domain, PATH_GAP_BREAK_SECONDS));\n+  els.diagnosticCorrectedPath.setAttribute(\"d\", diagnosticPitchPath(diagnostic.points_corrected, domain, PATH_GAP_BREAK_SECONDS));\n+}\n+\n+function formatCount(value) {\n+  const number = Number(value || 0);\n+  return number.toLocaleString(\"es-CL\");\n+}\n+\n+function diagnosticChartDomain(diagnostic) {\n+  const allPoints = [\n+    ...(diagnostic.points_raw || []),\n+    ...(diagnostic.points_filtered || []),\n+    ...(diagnostic.points_corrected || [])\n+  ].filter(([, midi]) => Number.isFinite(midi));\n+  const times = allPoints.map(([time]) => Number(time || 0));\n+  const notes = allPoints.map(([, midi]) => midi);\n+\n+  return {\n+    xMin: 0,\n+    xMax: Math.max(1, Math.max(...times, currentSong()?.duration || 1)),\n+    yMin: notes.length ? Math.floor(Math.min(...notes)) - 1 : 48,\n+    yMax: notes.length ? Math.ceil(Math.max(...notes)) + 1 : 72\n+  };\n+}\n+\n+function diagnosticX(time, domain) {\n+  return 64 + ((time - domain.xMin) / (domain.xMax - domain.xMin)) * 1096;\n+}\n+\n+function diagnosticY(midi, domain) {\n+  return 386 - ((midi - domain.yMin) / Math.max(1, domain.yMax - domain.yMin)) * 326;\n+}\n+\n+function renderDiagnosticGrid(domain) {\n+  els.diagnosticGridLayer.innerHTML = \"\";\n+  for (let midi = Math.ceil(domain.yMin); midi <= Math.floor(domain.yMax); midi += 1) {\n+    const y = diagnosticY(midi, domain);\n+    const line = document.createElementNS(\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", \"line\");\n+    line.setAttribute(\"class\", \"diagnostic-grid-line\");\n+    line.setAttribute(\"x1\", \"64\");\n+    line.setAttribute(\"x2\", \"1160\");\n+    line.setAttribute(\"y1\", y.toFixed(1));\n+    line.setAttribute(\"y2\", y.toFixed(1));\n+    els.diagnosticGridLayer.appendChild(line);\n+\n+    const label = document.createElementNS(\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", \"text\");\n+    label.setAttribute(\"class\", \"diagnostic-note-label\");\n+    label.setAttribute(\"x\", \"16\");\n+    label.setAttribute(\"y\", (y + 4).toFixed(1));\n+    label.textContent = noteName(midi);\n+    els.diagnosticGridLayer.appendChild(label);\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function diagnosticPitchPath(points, domain, gapBreak) {\n+  if (!Array.isArray(points) || !points.length) return \"\";\n+\n+  const commands = [];\n+  points.forEach(([time, midi], index) => {\n+    if (!Number.isFinite(time) || !Number.isFinite(midi)) return;\n+    const previous = points[index - 1];\n+    const startsSegment = !previous || time - previous[0] > gapBreak;\n+    commands.push(`${startsSegment ? \"M\" : \"L\"} ${diagnosticX(time, domain).toFixed(1)} ${diagnosticY(midi, domain).toFixed(1)}`);\n+  });\n+  return commands.join(\" \");\n+}\n+\n function takeShortSummary(metrics) {\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a06250-2d9c-72d1-9bef-2f4aeae2592e", "item_id": "item-688", "rollout_ordinal": 4355, "created_at_ms": 1788355817096, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 4355, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-688", "clientId": "a1346adc-24f9-4da5-9906-beda87073b3f", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "puedes terminar de hacer lo que estabas haciendo antes que se me acabaran los créditos\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a06250-2d9c-72d1-9bef-2f4aeae2592e", "item_id": "item-689", "rollout_ordinal": 4356, "created_at_ms": 1788355829328, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 4356, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-689", "summary": ["**Inspecting code for incomplete frontend changes**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a06250-2d9c-72d1-9bef-2f4aeae2592e", "item_id": "item-690", "rollout_ordinal": 4358, "created_at_ms": 1788355837373, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 4358, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-690", "text": "Claro. Retomo justo donde quedó: estábamos bajando la agresividad del filtro de octava, agregando diagnóstico crudo/filtrado/corregido y conectando esa vista a la interfaz. Voy a revisar si quedó algo a medio conectar y cerrar con validaciones.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a06250-2d9c-72d1-9bef-2f4aeae2592e", "item_id": "item-691", "rollout_ordinal": 4369, "created_at_ms": 1788355848545, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 4369, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-691", "summary": ["**Adding event listener for diagnostics and calling renderReferenceDiagnostic at initialization**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a06250-2d9c-72d1-9bef-2f4aeae2592e", "item_id": "item-692", "rollout_ordinal": 4371, "created_at_ms": 1788355855634, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 4371, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-692", "text": "Ya veo que el código quedó compilando, pero faltaban algunos remates: el botón de diagnóstico aún no tenía listener, la vista no se refrescaba al cambiar estados, y faltaba estilo para las etiquetas de notas del diagnóstico. Voy a cerrar eso ahora.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a06250-2d9c-72d1-9bef-2f4aeae2592e", "item_id": "item-693", "rollout_ordinal": 4382, "created_at_ms": 1788355883862, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 4384, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-693", "summary": ["**Planning diagnostic error handling**", "**Implementing diagnostic state and rendering updates**", "**Designing responsive diagnostics CSS and testing octave correction**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a06250-2d9c-72d1-9bef-2f4aeae2592e", "item_id": "item-694", "rollout_ordinal": 4386, "created_at_ms": 1788355884783, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 4386, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-694", "text": "Voy a terminar los detalles pendientes de la vista: botón conectado, estado de error persistente, refresco del botón según canción/backend, y responsividad para que el sexto ítem del menú no quede raro.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
