{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a08166-d8cf-78c0-a7d1-f1ab8c3e258e", "item_id": "item-828", "rollout_ordinal": 5336, "created_at_ms": 1788877619041, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 5336, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-828", "text": "Voy a añadir el CSS del modal con el mismo lenguaje visual de la app: superficies oscuras, borde suave, acento dorado y campos propios en vez de prompts nativos del navegador.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a08166-d8cf-78c0-a7d1-f1ab8c3e258e", "item_id": "call_NTHc93TBiObhaHaxB44XZMjd", "rollout_ordinal": 5339, "created_at_ms": 1788877632330, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 5339, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_NTHc93TBiObhaHaxB44XZMjd", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\styles.css", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -350,2 +350,106 @@\n \n+.modal-open {\n+  overflow: hidden;\n+}\n+\n+.modal-backdrop {\n+  position: fixed;\n+  z-index: 60;\n+  inset: 0;\n+  display: grid;\n+  place-items: center;\n+  padding: 24px;\n+  background: rgba(5, 6, 5, 0.72);\n+  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n+}\n+\n+.song-modal {\n+  width: min(480px, 100%);\n+  display: grid;\n+  gap: 16px;\n+  padding: 20px;\n+  color: var(--ink);\n+  background:\n+    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(241, 197, 91, 0.08), transparent 140px),\n+    var(--surface);\n+  border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n+}\n+\n+.modal-head,\n+.modal-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+}\n+\n+.modal-head h2 {\n+  margin-bottom: 0;\n+}\n+\n+.modal-close {\n+  width: 38px;\n+  min-height: 38px;\n+  padding: 0;\n+  font-size: 24px;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+\n+.selected-file {\n+  display: grid;\n+  gap: 5px;\n+  padding: 12px;\n+  background: rgba(241, 244, 239, 0.06);\n+  border: 1px solid var(--line);\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+}\n+\n+.selected-file span,\n+.modal-field span {\n+  color: var(--muted);\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  font-weight: 760;\n+  text-transform: uppercase;\n+}\n+\n+.selected-file strong {\n+  overflow: hidden;\n+  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n+  white-space: nowrap;\n+}\n+\n+.modal-field {\n+  display: grid;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+\n+.modal-field input {\n+  width: 100%;\n+  min-height: 44px;\n+  padding: 0 13px;\n+  color: var(--ink);\n+  background: var(--surface-2);\n+  border: 1px solid var(--line);\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+\n+.modal-field input:focus {\n+  border-color: rgba(241, 197, 91, 0.76);\n+  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(241, 197, 91, 0.14);\n+}\n+\n+.modal-error {\n+  min-height: 18px;\n+  margin: 0;\n+  color: #ffaaa4;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+.modal-actions {\n+  justify-content: flex-end;\n+}\n+\n .song-browser,\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a08166-d8cf-78c0-a7d1-f1ab8c3e258e", "item_id": "item-829", "rollout_ordinal": 5344, "created_at_ms": 1788877639688, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 5344, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-829", "text": "Una mejora pequeña en backend: envolveré la verificación de tarea activa con el mismo lock que usa el resto de operaciones, para que el selector de archivo no se dispare si ya hay algo procesando audio.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
